[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:33. Out of the Darkness]
[00:00.520]Passage 33 | 文章三十三
[00:02.360]Out of the darkness. | 走出黑暗。
[00:05.415]Nearly a week passed before the girl was able to explain what had happened to her. | 差不多一个星期过去了，女孩才能够解释发生在她身上的事情。
[00:12.770]One afternoon, she set out from the coast in a small boat and was caught in a storm. | 一天下午，她乘小船从海岸出发，结果遭遇了风暴。
[00:20.710]Towards evening, the boat struck a rock, and the girl jumped into the sea. | 傍晚时分，船撞上了一块岩石，女孩跳进了海里。
[00:27.240]Then she swam to the shore after spending the whole night in the water. | 然后她在水里度过了一整夜，游到了岸边。
[00:33.825]During that time, she covered a distance of 8 miles. | 在那段时间里，她游了8英里。
[00:40.060]Early next morning, she saw a light ahead. | 第二天清晨，她看到前方有一束光。
[00:44.650]She knew she was near the shore because the light was high up on the cliffs. | 她知道自己离岸边很近了，因为那束光在高高的悬崖上。
[00:50.220]On arriving at the shore, the girl struggled up the cliff towards the light she had seen. | 抵达岸边后，女孩艰难地爬上悬崖，朝着她看到的光亮走去。
[00:57.470]That was all she remembered. | 那就是她所记得的一切。
[01:00.910]When she woke up a day later, she found herself in hospital. | 一天后她醒来时，发现自己躺在医院里。